Named Brutal Deluxe because Speedball 2 was a kick ass game -Calvin


=== History ===

Calvin, n0p, m0rm0r and Golden was all in the same class at KTH Haninge.
They used to ride together in Goldens Volvo240 to their games which they played at their school KTH.
Brutal Deluxe also went to visit and play at AskerLan in Norway two times.
In 2003 they went to Copenhagen to play versus the danish clan [[Nasty Beasts Inc]] at a gaming-cafe.

